## Access metadata

When looking at a dataset, choose the "RDF" tab to see the metadata in machine readable form.

Note: While the Norwegian NAP supports mobilityDCAT-AP, most of the datasets are currently described using [DCAT-AP-NO](https://informasjonsforvaltning.github.io/dcat-ap-no/#_abstract_in_english), the Norwegian application profile of DCAT-AP. mobilityDCAT-AP will be added to more datasets during 2027.

## Harvest metadata

All the metadata in the NAP can be accessed both as a downloadable file and via an API, see the [documentation](https://data.norge.no/en/datasets/766d57bf-6b45-347e-80fe-ddbb47f663f0/dataset-descriptions-in-transportportalno).

Note: The dowloadable file contains both metadata following DCAT-AP-NO and mobilityDCAT-AP.
